  }

  note bottom of "reporting.property_values"
    Masking rule (ADR-034 §3.2, REQ-160):
    every view is WITH (security_barrier = true) and
    resolves reporting_ctx.current_context() once per
    statement. Restricted values are masked in the
    PROJECTION, e.g.
      CASE WHEN pd.id = ANY(ctx.readable_all)
             OR v.entity_id = ANY(ctx.scoped[pd.id])
           THEN v.value_text END
    so WHERE, GROUP BY, aggregates and errors only see
    masked values. Property-visibility override
    (REQ-128) does not apply. Soft-deleted rows excluded.
    Not exposed in v1: entity history, audit data,
    accounts, credentials, sessions, roles/assignments,
    service accounts, settings, auth providers,
    catalog/dashboard configuration.
    Owner: oea_reporting_owner; oea_analytics: SELECT.
    Documented, versioned interface (ADR-013 rules).
  end note

}

