' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Change notes
' 2026-10-13 (ADR-032, security review 2026-10):
'   roles → authorization_roles without business attributes (DM-1, DM-3);
'   permissions + role_permissions (DM-2); person_roles → role_assignments
'   with source/grant/approval/revocation data, no hard delete (DM-4, Q15);
'   idp_group_mappings (DM-5); remote system admin = mapping to
'   'system-admin' (DM-6); persons.entity_id account link (DM-7);
'   property_visibility_roles with authorization role IDs (DM-9);
'   sessions/session_idp_roles/refresh_tokens (DM-10, REQ-164, REQ-165, Q16);
'   persons.active → persons.status lifecycle (REQ-004, REQ-164);
'   person_identities (iss, sub) binding (REQ-166); system_admin_accounts
'   table (UC-02, previously only in the BO); local_credentials extended
'   (argon2id only, TOTP last time step, temporary passwords, recovery codes,
'   owner may be the system admin account; REQ-169, REQ-170, REQ-171, REQ-173);
'   machine_credentials with expiry and stable client_id (REQ-176).
' 2026-10-13 (ADR-033 audit trail hardening, DM-A1..DM-A10):
'   audit.events: actor_id/actor_name/actor_email replaced by actor_type +
'   actor_person_id/actor_admin_id (pseudonymous, SEC-28/REQ-189);
'   event_category, severity, outcome, source_ip, target_type, target_id,
'   details; entity_name NULL for modeled persons; agent_id = client_id only,
